@startuml 顺序图-UC10-签到核验
title 顺序图 · UC-10 签到核验（含 UC-04 签到场景）
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 170
autonumber
hide footbox

actor "预约用户" as User
participant "我的预约 / 签到界面" as UI
participant "签到控制器\n(应用服务)" as Controller
participant "预约规则校验器\nReservationPolicy" as Policy
participant "预约仓储" as Repo
database "数据库" as DB
participant "通知服务\n(Outbox)" as Notify

User -> UI: 扫描二维码 / 输入签到码 / 点击签到
UI -> Controller: POST /reservations/{id}/check-ins\nIdempotency-Key + credential
Controller -> Repo: findByRequestId(userId, requestId)
Repo -> DB: 查询签到幂等记录
DB --> Repo: no record
Repo --> Controller: no record

Controller -> Repo: lockAndLoad(reservationId)
Repo -> DB: BEGIN + SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
DB --> Repo: reservation(version, status)
Repo --> Controller: reservation
Controller -> Policy: validateCheckIn(reservation, operator, credential)
Policy -> Policy: 校验归属、权限、ACTIVE 状态、\n签到窗、教室匹配、凭证签名

alt 校验失败
  Controller -> DB: ROLLBACK
  alt 已超时或已自动释放
    Controller --> UI: 410 CHECK_IN_WINDOW_CLOSED
  else 其他规则不通过
    Controller --> UI: 422 RULE_VIOLATION
  end
  UI --> User: 提示具体原因
else 校验通过
  Controller -> Repo: saveCheckIn(checkIn, status=IN_USE,\nidempotencyRecord, outbox)
  Repo -> DB: INSERT check_in\nUPDATE reservation SET IN_USE\nINSERT idempotency_record\nINSERT notification_outbox\nCOMMIT
  DB --> Repo: committed
  Repo --> Controller: checkIn + newVersion
  Controller --> UI: 201 Created\nfirstCheckIn=true
  UI --> User: 展示“签到成功”和结束时间
  Note over Notify, DB: 结束时间到达后由完成任务\n置为 COMPLETED 并释放时段
end

Note over Controller, DB
  重复请求：若幂等记录已存在，
  直接返回首次签到时间，不再写签到记录。
  若自动释放先取得行锁，本次签到失败并返回 410。
end note
@enduml
